header: "---\nname: jake-whale-case-study\ndescription: \"Case Study. Turns the first customer into proof, with their permission. Once the product has shipped, it writes a short before-and-after from their real numbers and their real words, and keeps it marked as a draft until they have approved that exact text in writing. Change a word and it asks again. Use when the user says \\\"case study\\\", \\\"testimonial\\\", \\\"customer story\\\", \\\"get a quote from them\\\", \\\"write up the result\\\", \\\"social proof\\\", \\\"can I use their name\\\", or once a customer has seen results.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/whale-skill\n  upstream_skill: case-study\n  upstream_commit: 67390fc00e9c33f2d9f9ed5c3d52e330d520dc72\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
